# Architecture
- API: NestJS modules under src/modules; Prisma for persistence
- Web: React + TipTap; serialize via src/lib/blocks.ts
- Every entity scoped by workspaceId; use WorkspaceAccessService
- Autosave uses Page.contentVersion optimistic lock (409 on conflict)
- Realtime is Socket.IO namespace /sync — do not invent a second protocol
